title: "Embodify: Give Your Agent a Body"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Yida
version: 0.1.0a1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/YidaYang/embodify"
url: "https://github.com/YidaYang/embodify"
abstract: >-
  Embodify lets the agent you already use, such as Claude Code or Codex, observe and
  control robots through an MCP server and a pack of agent skills, with simulator
  backends for LIBERO and RoboDojo.
keywords:
  - embodied AI
  - robotics
  - robot manipulation
  - MCP
  - LLM agents
  - agent evaluation
